<item><title>Togo opens 17-day Lomé trade fair with India as guest of honour</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-opens-17-day-lome-trade-fair-with-india-as-guest-of-a25cf2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-opens-17-day-lome-trade-fair-with-india-as-guest-of-a25cf2/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The event brings exhibitors, investors and business operators from Togo and other countries to CETEF TOGO, a conference and exhibition centre in Lomé, through 13 December.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 07:22:43 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Togo brings 176 citizens home from Mali after departures from Guinea</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-brings-176-citizens-home-from-mali-after-departures-300ddc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-brings-176-citizens-home-from-mali-after-departures-300ddc/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The government received the returnees at three sites and is still identifying Togolese in Burkina Faso who want to come home.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 07:00:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-brings-176-citizens-home-from-mali-after-departures-300ddc/share.jpg" length="43279" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-brings-176-citizens-home-from-mali-after-departures-300ddc/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Togo opposition calls for urgent search for missing priest</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-opposition-calls-for-urgent-search-for-missing-priest-007961/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-opposition-calls-for-urgent-search-for-missing-priest-007961/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>Four opposition groups, including the Manifeste Génération Togo, urged authorities to find Father Éric Ébélaki, a vicar in Kara, and return him safely.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:53:04 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Togo police seize 6 918 cartridges hidden in vehicle</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-police-seize-6-918-cartridges-hidden-in-vehicle-886ee8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-police-seize-6-918-cartridges-hidden-in-vehicle-886ee8/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The ammunition was found in a vehicle travelling from Ghana through Togo toward Nigeria, and the driver said he had made two earlier trips.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:10:34 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
